# Cloudflare Pages rewrites (this repo's Pages project serves the repo
# ROOT, so the Telegram section lives at site/telegram/ on disk).
#
# The Telegram search page is published at /telegram/ (the URL the
# Kindle OPDS catalog links to), rewritten internally to
# /site/telegram/ — a 200 rewrite, not a redirect, so the URL stays
# /telegram/ and the page's relative fetch("index.json") keeps working.
# The OPDS feeds at the root (/khazendar/, /sahwa/, /electronic/,
# /hindawi/, /doab/, /index.xml) are untouched by this rule.
# If the rewrite ever stops working, the section is still directly
# reachable at /site/telegram/.
/telegram/*  /site/telegram/:splat  200
# Newspapers (link-out only): /newspapers/ is the "other papers" page;
# the data file is /site/newspapers.json (fetched by both pages).
/newspapers/*  /site/newspapers/:splat  200
